Source: qcnpuperfmon
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: samfreund-qc <freund@qti.qualcomm.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, pkg-config, libqcnpuperf-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: qcnpuperfd
Architecture: any
Depends: libqcnpuperf1, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qualcomm NPU performance metrics daemon
 Polls DSP_NPU0 once per second and writes NPU performance metrics
 to /tmp/qcnpuperf_metrics using atomic rename. Designed to run
 under systemd on Qualcomm aarch64 Linux platforms.
